            "html": "<div class='sk-browser-window w-full'><div class='space-y-4 p-5'><h3 class='sk-heading text-xl'>Every feature, live</h3><div class='grid grid-cols-3 gap-3' data-part='gallery'><div class='sk-card space-y-2 p-3'><div class='sk-video-player h-16 w-full'></div><p class='font-bold'>Skeleton style</p><div class='sk-code-snippet'><p>&lt;PoseSkeleton /&gt;</p></div><a class='sk-link text-sm'>Open in playground</a></div><div class='sk-card space-y-2 p-3'><div class='sk-video-player h-16 w-full'></div><p class='font-bold'>Rules and feedback</p><div class='sk-code-snippet'><p>usePoseRule(...)</p></div><a class='sk-link text-sm'>Open in playground</a></div><div class='sk-card space-y-2 p-3'><div class='sk-video-player h-16 w-full'></div><p class='font-bold'>Record and replay</p><div class='sk-code-snippet'><p>usePoseReplay(...)</p></div><a class='sk-link text-sm'>Open in playground</a></div></div><p class='text-sm opacity-60'>6 more cards</p><h3 class='sk-heading text-xl'>Browser demo or your app</h3><div class='sk-table w-full' data-part='compareTable'><div class='sk-table-row sk-table-head'><span></span><span>This site</span><span>Your Expo app</span></div><div class='sk-table-row'><span>Runs in</span><span>Browser, MediaPipe for web</span><span>iOS and Android, native</span></div><div class='sk-table-row'><span>Model</span><span>pose_landmarker_full</span><span>The same file</span></div><div class='sk-table-row'><span>Rules, angles, styles</span><span>Same logic</span><span>Same options</span></div></div><h3 class='sk-heading text-xl'>For agents</h3><div class='grid grid-cols-2 gap-3' data-part='agentsSection'><div class='sk-code-snippet'><p>Read SKILL.md, then add a squat counter</p></div><div class='sk-card p-3'><p>SKILL.md and llms.txt give an agent the API and the traps.</p></div></div><h3 class='sk-heading text-xl'>FAQ</h3><div class='sk-accordion w-full' data-part='faq'><div class='sk-accordion-item' data-checked><div class='sk-accordion-trigger'>